<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Anonymity reflects on how secretive a person finds their identity and personality to be. A pawn with this belief will feel happier when it’s high and unhappy when it’s nearing depletion. Anonymity slowly rises over time and any social interaction or exposed facial features will lower it.-->
  <VME_Anonymity.description>暴露我们的名字、容貌与背景也并非明智之举。这或许是种祝福，但更可能是种诅咒。</VME_Anonymity.description>
  <!--EN: anonymity-->
  <VME_Anonymity.label>无名之辈</VME_Anonymity.label>
  <!--EN: Corruption reflects a person's desire to give in to the dark, eldritch, and possibly even violent desires deeply embedded within them; a mildly corrupt pawn cannot lose ideological certainty. Corruption slowly fades daily, but can be paused by nearby obelisks and increased by incantation rituals. Upon reaching 100 corruption a pawn will immediately begin mentally breaking, and upon reaching 0 a pawn will easily be swayed to any other ideoligion-->
  <VME_Corruption.description>堕落值反映了人物对于屈从黑暗、外神以及内心强欲的渴望；轻度堕落者不会失去对自己某些文化形态的认可值。虽然堕落值每天都会缓慢减少，但可以通过待在不详方尖碑附近来阻止或通过举行诅咒仪式来增加。当堕落值达到100%时，人物将会立刻陷入精神崩溃状态；当堕落值达到0%时，人物将很容易被其他文化形态所动摇。</VME_Corruption.description>
  <!--EN: corruption-->
  <VME_Corruption.label>堕落</VME_Corruption.label>
</LanguageData>
